{"id":"d4635c6e179ddf8a","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-center-abelian.md","title":"thm-center-abelian","display":"thm-center-abelian","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-commutator]]","[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-congruence-modular]]"],"display":"thm-center-abelian","label":"93-thm-center-abelian","aliases":["93-thm-center-abelian"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"18ca772ab524a46f\" href=\"?note=18ca772ab524a46f\" title=\"93-df-commutator\">93-df-commutator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c8ff2f79b6a4018b\" href=\"?note=c8ff2f79b6a4018b\" title=\"93-df-congruence-modular\">93-df-congruence-modular</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-center-abelian"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-center-abelian"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-center-abelian</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-center-abelian-thm-center-abelian\">thm-center-abelian <code>thm-center-abelian</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[-,-]_{\\mathbf A}\">\\([-,-]_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> is the commutator of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"18ca772ab524a46f\" href=\"?note=18ca772ab524a46f\" title=\"93-df-commutator\">93-df-commutator</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}center\\text{-}abelian}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists!\\zeta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\\Bigl[\n[\\zeta,\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n\\bigl([\\theta,\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\n\\to\\theta\\subseteq\\zeta\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}center\\text{-}abelian}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists!\\zeta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\\Bigl[\n[\\zeta,\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n\\bigl([\\theta,\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\n\\to\\theta\\subseteq\\zeta\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This center is the greatest central congruence, not the element-valued lattice center of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"15425ce9f60b808b\" href=\"?note=15425ce9f60b808b\" title=\"93-df-center\">93-df-center</a>. The maximality clause is part of the theorem rather than hidden in an undefined local predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-center-abelian-thm-center-abelian","text":"thm-center-abelian `thm-center-abelian`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-commutator","status":"resolved","id":"18ca772ab524a46f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-commutator]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-modular","status":"resolved","id":"c8ff2f79b6a4018b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence-modular]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-commutator","status":"resolved","id":"18ca772ab524a46f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[-,-]_{\\mathbf A}$ is the commutator of [[93-df-commutator]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-center","status":"resolved","id":"15425ce9f60b808b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"This center is the greatest central congruence, not the element-valued lattice center of [[93-df-center]]. The maximality clause is part of the theorem rather than hidden in an undefined local predicate.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"[-,-]_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}center\\text{-}abelian}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\\\\n&\\to\\exists!\\zeta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\\Bigl[\n[\\zeta,\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n\\bigl([\\theta,\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\n\\to\\theta\\subseteq\\zeta\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1192,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["18ca772ab524a46f","30b341bfbd8b5301","c8ff2f79b6a4018b","15425ce9f60b808b"]}